    <string name="about_title">SSWR</string>
    <string name="about_text">\
        SSWR: Pregnancy Week Calculator\n
        Which week of pregnancy are you in? What would be written in your maternity logbook, or what would your midwife say?
        Simply enter your estimated due date (EDD) to calculate your current week of pregnancy.\n
    </string>
